Vendored sources originate from:
  src/nouveau/compiler/nak/*.rs
  src/compiler/rust/*.rs (pure Rust support modules only)
  src/compiler/rust/proc/*.rs
  src/nouveau/rust/bitview/lib.rs
  src/nouveau/headers/struct_parser.py and util.py

Local adaptations:
  Cargo manifests and public module visibility for a standalone Rust crate.
    The compiler helper's Rustdoc snippets omit type imports and were not run
    by upstream Meson; its Cargo manifest disables those three doctests while
    preserving exact source text. All 46 helper unit tests are enabled.
  api.rs is replaced by a safe Rust entrypoint with the upstream pass chain
    and debug flags. C NIR preprocessing and C/DRM bindings are omitted.
  ir.rs and sph.rs import local safe Rust mirrors of the three C records
    they reference. ShaderModelInfo dispatch accepts SM50 and SM52 only.
  lib.rs excludes C NIR, C API, QMD, other generations and hardware tests.
  Graphics metadata initialization, validation and integration tests are
    SGFX additions. Upstream algorithms and instruction encoding remain.

